digraph account_payable_process_111 {
	graph [rankdir=LR]
	START_NODE [label="" shape=circle width=0.3]
	subgraph CLUSTER_0 {
		"send to the senior accountant in your department" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" [shape=box]
		"send to the senior accountant in your department" -> "create a receiving report"
		"OR_SPLIT--3. Document validation_0SHO" [label=O fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"create a receiving report" -> "OR_SPLIT--3. Document validation_0SHO"
		"report errors to relevant team member" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--3. Document validation_0SHO" -> "report errors to relevant team member"
		"confirm all documents have been amended" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--3. Document validation_0SHO" -> "confirm all documents have been amended"
		"gather the vendors invoice" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--3. Document validation_0SHO" -> "gather the vendors invoice"
		"OR_JOIN--3. Document validation_0SHO" [label=O fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"report errors to relevant team member" -> "OR_JOIN--3. Document validation_0SHO"
		"confirm all documents have been amended" -> "OR_JOIN--3. Document validation_0SHO"
		"gather the vendors invoice" -> "OR_JOIN--3. Document validation_0SHO"
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_5W2S" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"OR_JOIN--3. Document validation_0SHO" -> "AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_5W2S"
		"stamp all documents" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_5W2S" -> "stamp all documents"
		"check dates to avoid penalty charges" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_5W2S" -> "check dates to avoid penalty charges"
		"OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_2C3W" [label=O fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"stamp all documents" -> "OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_2C3W"
		"store in paid invoice file" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_2C3W" -> "store in paid invoice file"
		"enter the invoice into the accounts payable account" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_2C3W" -> "enter the invoice into the accounts payable account"
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_WQ0V" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"enter the invoice into the accounts payable account" -> "AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_WQ0V"
		"schedule the payment" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_WQ0V" -> "schedule the payment"
		"create voucher for the documents" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_WQ0V" -> "create voucher for the documents"
		"AND_JOIN--4. Payment_WQ0V" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"schedule the payment" -> "AND_JOIN--4. Payment_WQ0V"
		"create voucher for the documents" -> "AND_JOIN--4. Payment_WQ0V"
		"OR_JOIN--4. Payment_2C3W" [label=O fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"store in paid invoice file" -> "OR_JOIN--4. Payment_2C3W"
		"AND_JOIN--4. Payment_WQ0V" -> "OR_JOIN--4. Payment_2C3W"
		"AND_JOIN--4. Payment_5W2S" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"OR_JOIN--4. Payment_2C3W" -> "AND_JOIN--4. Payment_5W2S"
		"check dates to avoid penalty charges" -> "AND_JOIN--4. Payment_5W2S"
	}
	START_NODE -> "send to the senior accountant in your department"
	END_NODE [label="" shape=doublecircle width=0.2]
	"AND_JOIN--4. Payment_5W2S" -> END_NODE
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following description is about the account payable process. It begins when you send to the senior accountant in your department. 
After sending to the senior accountant in your department, creating a receiving report should be done. 
Once creating a receiving report occurs, one or more of the following paths should be executed: reporting errors to relevant team member, confirming all documents have been amended, gathering the vendors invoice. 
After that, the next tasks should be stamping all documents and checking dates to avoid penalty charges, they should be done in parallel. 
When stamping all documents is completed, one or more of the following paths should be executed: storing in paid invoice file, entering the invoice into the accounts payable account. 
After entering the invoice into the accounts payable account, the next tasks should be scheduling the payment and creating voucher for the documents, they should be done in parallel. 
The process is now completed. 
"
}
